{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Note - The game is currently in early stage of development after 2 years of solo development. Consider checking Discord and Reddit links for development process info.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891930/extras/2a69844ada645567453eaef2923de7d8.apng?t=1764531246\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891930/extras/2a69844ada645567453eaef2923de7d8.poster.avif?t=1764531246\" class=\"bb_img\" width=130 height=110 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891930/extras/0edead7f8c9139c386d7c3e4e2a927e6.avif?t=1764531246\" width=179 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891930/extras/684afa9d5446dde9904ec8f4b8bcfaab.avif?t=1764531246\" width=123 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a cozy journey through a peculiar and eclectic world of the afterlife.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns out the world of death isn\u2019t so dead - just a little\u2026 abandoned. There\u2019s a whole town waiting for you to rebuild, a host of strange undead to meet and befriend, and one big mystery to solve: how did you end up here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891930/extras/ea2dd6bbbaf94132bdd27d63cb6b3717.avif?t=1764531246\" width=152 height=273 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891930/extras/a8b414fc5af75b93aa5872cc248e9892.avif?t=1764531246\" width=158 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuild a forgotten town</strong>\u00a0- pave roads, build homes, and shape the community to be as cozy, beautiful, and comfortable as you wish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live their stories</strong> \u2013 uncover the heartwarming and heartbreaking tales of 10 unique characters, each with their own hopes and regrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape their lives</strong> \u2013 your town\u2019s layout determines NPC schedules. No park? No strolls in the park.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet them all</strong> \u2013 find dozens of undead pets, earn their trust, take care of them, and discover their unexpected skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm like never before</strong> \u2013 grow everything from pungent mushrooms to floating plants and shimmering crystals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gardening with a twist</strong> \u2013 each plant has unique needs. Discover their secrets through lost pages of a botanic diary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade in essence</strong> \u2013 forget money. Harvest the world\u2019s strange essence to craft, trade, and\u2026 maybe uncover where it came from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side activities - </strong>Fishing? Cooking? Mini-games? Yes! <br><i>Some of the features are in development.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to live no matter what? It's never too late.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891930?t=1764531246","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891930?t=1764531246","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891930/8b872dde4f531a2c01cc97389df96a2140fa54d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1