nd befriend, and one big mystery to solve: how did you end up here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891930/extras/ea2dd6bbbaf94132bdd27d63cb6b3717.avif?t=1764531246\" width=152 height=273 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891930/extras/a8b414fc5af75b93aa5872cc248e9892.avif?t=1764531246\" width=158 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuild a forgotten town</strong>\u00a0- pave roads, build homes, and shape the community to be as cozy, beautiful, and comfortable as you wish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live their stories</strong> \u2013 uncover the heartwarming and heartbreaking tales of 10 unique characters, each with their own hopes and regrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape their lives</strong> \u2013 your town\u2019s layout determines NPC schedules. No park? No strolls in the park.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet them all</strong> \u2013 find dozens of undead pets, earn their trust, take care of them, and discover their unexpected skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm like never before</strong> \u2013 grow everything from pungent mushrooms to floating plants and shimmering crystals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gardening with a twist</strong> \u2013 each plant has unique needs. Discover their secrets through lost pages of a botanic diary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade in essence</strong> \u2013 forget money. Harvest the world\u2019s strange essence to craft, trade, and\u2026 maybe uncover where it came from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side activities - </strong>Fishing? Cooking? Mini-games? Yes! <br><i>Some of the features are in development.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to live no matter what? It's never too late.</p>","developers":["Tranquil Beast"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891930/63018e80c6f75bb0c3626b98290142582e448e35/header.jpg?t=1764531246","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Death Afterparty","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or better<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, shader model 3.0+<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Tranquil Beast"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shar