be7c555cfb7eb3b03eb1dfbde99ced5e2e6/ss_860a3be7c555cfb7eb3b03eb1dfbde99ced5e2e6.600x338.jpg?t=1764531246"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891930/261d8fbab3723e0146cab2a5944c24dea7180de7/ss_261d8fbab3723e0146cab2a5944c24dea7180de7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764531246","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891930/261d8fbab3723e0146cab2a5944c24dea7180de7/ss_261d8fbab3723e0146cab2a5944c24dea7180de7.600x338.jpg?t=1764531246"}],"short_description":"So, it seems you died\u2026 but no worries! Explore a cozy afterlife, befriend peculiar undead from skeletons to gargoyles, and build up a town to brighten their afterlife. Uncover their heartwarming and heartbreaking stories, and discover your own. Everyone carry their final regret. What's yours?","steam_appid":3891930,"support_info":{"email":"tranquillbeast@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}